# Designing for the bar

The screen is a {{.D.Display.LandscapeW}} × {{.D.Display.LandscapeH}} px strip, about {{num .D.Display.MMW}} × {{num .D.Display.MMH}} mm ({{num .D.Display.PxPerMM}} px per mm), read at a glance and touched with a fingertip. It has two buttons and no keyboard. These patterns follow from that; the recipes in `recipes.md` implement them, and `ui_lint` checks the hard limits.

